        "title": "How to read this",
        "body": "The scheme says what a click should do. This page says what it does now, so that the gap between the two can be built in a sensible order.\n\nEverything here was read from the code, not found by using the app. Where I did not trace something to the end, it says so. Each difference has three lines: what happens today, what the scheme says, and what the work is.",
