        "title": "Where this was read",
        "body": "The files each finding came from, for whoever builds the change.\n\n- Tiles, selection and focus: `docs/multi-graph-workspace.md`, `components/GraphEditor/components/WorkspaceLayer.js`\n- Node focus and the camera: `handleNodeFocus` in `components/GraphEditor/handlers/graphEditorHandlers.js`, `components/GraphEditor/utils/focusTransition.js`\n- Portals: `handleUnfoldGraph`, `handleNavigate` and `handlePrimaryAction` in `components/GraphEditor/Nodes/PortNode.js`\n- Double-click: `handleNodeDoubleClickOpenSource` in `components/GraphEditor/GraphEditorContent.js`\n- Opening beside or replacing: `navigateTo` in `components/GraphEditor/hooks/useGraphWorkspace.js`\n- History and Step out: `recordNavigation`, `navigateWorkspaceHistory` and `stepOut` in the same file\n- Links: `components/GraphEditor/components/TlzLink.js`, `components/GraphEditor/components/pageLinkClick.js`\n- Keys: `components/GraphEditor/hooks/useGraphShortcuts.js`\n- Following a port’s label: `components/NodeGraph/portLabelNavigation.js`\n- Which gesture belongs to what: `components/NodeGraph/interactionArbiter.js`",
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "navigation-today"
        }
